  "details": "I'm playing on Oculus Rift through Steam VR, and I primarily play sitting in my chair. VR Chat loads me in with Seated Position on in the hub, and I think when I switch back to the hub from another world it's usually okay, but when going from world to world (or hub to another world), it always toggles me back to Standing Position during the load animation. (Load interface is in front of me, then suddenly shifts to 5 ft below me, and I have to re-enable Seated Position again after loading in.)\n\nLet me know if you need more details :)",
